#: ../../source/braces_README.md:382
msgid "brace expansion can eat up a huge amount of processing resources"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/braces_README.md:383
msgid ""
"as brace patterns increase _linearly in size_, the system resources "
"required to expand the pattern increase exponentially"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/braces_README.md:384
msgid ""
"users can accidentally (or intentially) exhaust your system's resources "
"resulting in the equivalent of a DoS attack (bonus: no programming "
"knowledge is required!)"
