"At minimum, brace patterns with sets limited to two elements have "
"quadradic or `O(n^2)` complexity. But the complexity of the algorithm "
"increases exponentially as the number of sets, _and elements per set_, "
"increases, which is `O(n^c)`."
msgstr ""

